  "description": "Love Magic is a charming bubble display font featuring soft rounded shapes and adorable heart details that bring a warm, playful personality to every project. Inspired by kawaii aesthetics and pastel themes, this font is perfect for Valentine’s Day creations, children’s products, greeting cards, t-shirts, hoodies, tote bags, mugs, stickers, nursery decor, classroom resources, Cricut crafts, scrapbook layouts, invitations, social media graphics, branding, and DIY projects. Its bold, friendly style ensures excellent readability while adding a cute and cheerful touch to both digital and print designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Love Magic is a charming bubble display font featuring soft rounded shapes and adorable heart details that bring a warm, playful personality to every project. Inspired by kawaii aesthetics and pastel themes, this font is perfect for Valentine’s Day creations, children’s products, greeting cards, t-shirts, hoodies, tote bags, mugs, stickers, nursery decor, classroom resources, Cricut crafts, scrapbook layouts, invitations, social media graphics, branding, and DIY projects. Its bold, friendly style ensures excellent readability while adding a cute and cheerful touch to both digital and print designs.</p>",
